<title>UK: Kingfisher prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGFISHER PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     8.125     MATURITY    14.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.767    PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    99.767    SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>		CALLABLE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
